{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國「性感女神」宋智孝近期為了自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」親自擔任形象模特兒，她毫不藏私地展現火辣曲線，完美勝任黑白經典款到雙面Bra系列，性感寫真曝光後立刻掀起網友熱議，紛紛大讚：「美得讓人窒息！」</p><p>宋智孝開創內衣事業</p><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148291073848643584910734.jpeg/luj7tND4e5Mg-VWyHb_S0_ZJnv21C2U9js5CzI7OQsw\"/><figcaption>宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148291076373745664816357.jpeg/H6PpP0xMZ-CFaetO9nwjK4a99Pe41Xc5859ih_OfYoc\"/><figcaption>宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148291079469273088789356.jpeg/rBJmR8nD5c5Q_caxlKY81A_Cr0VsZleOjbwSWI28Elg\"/><figcaption>宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148291083659513856371985.jpeg/xxHvqcZzSWfAz4xsMYOlznM1e6XhMrCYp-R6AafkegE\"/><figcaption>宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148291087560347648709834.jpeg/ny7YLQmJ-pQsljx2EwiMh6wx0YVnWh-A8ra9c_K2vXM\"/><figcaption>宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148291075878686720960837.jpeg/-HJoxNUNjWrrU8qTFeIZ2PzN_yeE0lkxmaQwLJmkMCw\"/><figcaption>宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝再度為自創內衣品牌