孝再度為自創內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」擔任形象模特兒。（Instagram@_nina.ssong_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝親自為自家品牌拍攝廣告照片，令人驚訝原來一直收藏着曲線玲瓏的好身材！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250105/952645775442579456019673.jpeg/hsgTEa0UbvASqLvQJj56Oo-O_5eIePoZxH6sL8R-rC8\"/><figcaption>宋智孝親自為自家品牌拍攝廣告照片，令人驚訝原來一直收藏着曲線玲瓏的好身材！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝的身材令人羨慕！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250105/952645769939259392196480.jpeg/xDzEP0-AHzhQqmsUdUYO2BAsKAXqoDDiGsRacBrEWnA\"/><figcaption>宋智孝的身材令人羨慕！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝的身材多角度拍攝下毫無贅肉！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250105/952645771730358272901834.jpeg/4CdDoedeL_ObMskDX2iDTkjN_YRQZpd07kSEJ-5EhCc\"/><figcaption>宋智孝的身材多角度拍攝下毫無贅肉！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝的身材多角度拍攝下毫無贅肉！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250105/952645773580177408268793.jpeg/hfdi_K6pbO-ep4AYECuiqtsjt51EUMebzdp_g83af4M\"/><figcaption>宋智孝的身材多角度拍攝下毫無贅肉！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝親自為自家品牌拍攝廣告照片，令人驚訝原來一直收藏着曲線玲瓏的好身材！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250105/952645766470438912729635.jpeg/y0eG0qR0g0PTY1AcN2AUPhWMJf4OT_YzEKl1mBCpdZg\"/><figcaption>宋智孝親自為自家品牌拍攝廣告照片，令人驚訝原來一直收藏着曲線玲瓏的好身材！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝的身材令人羨慕！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250105/952645768362070016293856.jpeg/mBx2CWzeTpKQdZKnaPreKTmuOYWltJhksUSKt7FEirc\"/><figcaption>宋智孝的身材令人羨慕！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"宋智孝親自為自家品牌拍攝廣告照片，令人驚訝原來一直收藏着曲線玲瓏的好身材！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250105/952645768714522624037296.jpeg/faFb8NRz7XYbBwLutLF_nxvmhxKdGOfoJWnqOSVp6jk\"/><figcaption>宋智孝親自為自家品牌拍攝廣告照片，令人驚訝原來一直收藏着曲線玲瓏的好身材！（NINA SSONG IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>宋智孝因出演韓綜《Running Man》廣受歡迎，被封為「懵智孝」、「Ace智孝」以及「不良智孝」，她在2024年12月29日正式推出個人內衣品牌「Nina.Ssong」，並出任CEO和專屬模特兒，自信解放玲瓏有的好身材，火辣曲線引發外界驚豔。「Nina.Ssong」主打親膚、舒適的無痕內衣與居家睡衣系列，宋智孝從直奔東大門挑選布料，到各大社群平台宣傳全都一手包辦。</p><p>嫵媚女人味電暈網友</p><p>今年春季宋智孝親自示範「Nina.Ssong」2款黑白經典內衣，她背對鏡頭面向牆壁，辣露纖腰美背，波浪般的長捲髮飄散出嫵媚女人味，雖然宋智孝沒有直視鏡頭，卻已讓大批網友們全都被電暈！在另一套白色內衣寫真當中，宋智孝也挑戰四角褲造型，展現私下居家慵懶的一面。</p><p>豐滿美胸不再藏！</p><p>日前「Nina.Ssong」官方IG再度PO出宋智孝親身演繹雙面Bra的全新寫真，藍綠、酷黑、卡其到紅色4款全放送，44歲的宋智孝撩髮甜笑綻放出性感風情，令網友們大讚：</p><p>「姊姊終於脫掉牛仔褲」</p><p>「哇，宋老闆，你太酷了」</p><p>「CEO兼模特兒」</p><p>「就是這樣，姊妹」</p><p>「美得讓人窒息」</p><p>「熟女最正」</p><p>「真正的危險！」</p><p>收穫無數好評。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：澤尻英龍華久違20年再出寫真　鏤空衫比堅尼齊上陣　2天即登榜首】澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（X@erika_photobook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136271372209623040942185.jpeg/RFHcBjOPCzWVLe6clY6WhtA104GJZXR-Qs3kUkLN5FI\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：澤尻英龍華久違20年再出寫真　鏤空衫比堅尼齊上陣　2天即登榜首】澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（X@erika_photobook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》（X@erika_photobook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273135096565760329856.jpeg/6r7MN3UI8Fpz7BA38y6E5bmBiCu24NiGnW4Eyp1uBMo\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》（X@erika_photobook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（X@erika_photobook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273137483255808238410.jpeg/KGM2J82I2FnOQAesil-_JpoPuCMJtCgL1JgC9dSYAvU\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（X@erika_photobook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（X@erika_photobook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273139828002816109762.jpeg/pnVfxOtcdXpFYMCOmasN3YRI2aDVIIBXktoT6ZLaE-k\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（X@erika_photobook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（amazon jp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273142093058048578291.png/vIfaFZSZAv0EFHjuZmLDRf_N6XyE8NtSm7hILZu4SC0\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（amazon jp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（amazon jp）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273144408444928285764.png/5eDg_FkWs8_6Ur95NtaU2A5eLx6DfbQQ5pk6v-aZOr8\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華寫真集《DAY OFF》公開的相片。（amazon jp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273326356828160395210.jpeg/rle87ST5HPTFsDzqrKqhJsdHWaiT7hcPfVgwHn1YMB4\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華（X@erika_photobook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273130109538304849561.jpeg/XFYFBofaM8N0-LhAyEaemdJOBLXCiiO8gqaPwYKmj8E\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華（X@erika_photobook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273566178742272796214.jpeg/dOdvVdk5ptIiLF5EkFONBgO1AP9jti9ZMYF54DGBeeA\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273568544460800781426.jpeg/hPCwaWSSdzEtjA-aBwDSH0B1cA2OeK5_PBmJbTwZiW0\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273570788544512183427.jpeg/J5k0A81-WuyYqA_77NLN-15WKxQZa2X77E_uC-xP7gs\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273572814524416167924.jpeg/n-9Udn4gHwMqgvCuNfZ97sHwhvl_T9s2droNx3a6Dcc\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273574706286592690485.jpeg/KO8u4wLFhjyQE2q2uaO52K8PeTUh1aArbFh0BGxYdAQ\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136273566161965056273490.jpeg/oNxSYJwq4LZohs3HQ5uc2R_ntMEOAjR6Wr4xZVq-MWU\"/><figcaption>澤尻英龍華（Instagram@erika_sawajiri_zone）</figcaption></figure><p>邊荷律《荷止微甜》簽書會大成功！會後緊協尋失智症祖母，今敬業出席五燈獎一日店長活動！</p><p>【本文獲「COOL潮流生活網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-30T14:44:21.923733+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2268,"images":34,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}